WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,270
Look at that gas station

2
00:00:01,270 --> 00:00:03,270
There must be a lot of oil in the ground

3
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:04,270
It would be nice if we could take it away

4
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:07,270
We don't have to worry about our car anymore.

5
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:08,270
The oil is all in underground pipes

6
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:11,270
You have to specialize in pumping oil and add the password to get it.

7
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,270
Power outage now

8
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:16,070
Those equipment are just useless.

9
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,070
Later my place will be big enough

10
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,070
Just open an excavator

11
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:21,070
Dig out the entire oil frame and take it away

12
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:24,220
Dig it out and take it away

13
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:36,250
Then we won’t have to worry about energy anymore and get in the car.

14
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,250
Don't ask

15
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:38,250
This is Su Hao's business
